<title>USA: Texaco holder suit without merit - spokesman.</title>
<headline>Texaco holder suit without merit - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shareholder derivative suit filed against Texaco Inc by shareholder Nathan Kaplan &quot;has no merit,&quot; company spokesman Jim Swords said.</p>
<p>The suit, disclosed Friday by Kaplan's lawyer, was filed Wednesday in the U.S. District Court in White Plains, N.Y., Swords said. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
